# Day-to-day: OAuth2 authorization-code sequence drawn as a flow; reciprocal request/response labeled edges.
title "OAuth2 authorization code"
dir DOWN
user(User)
app[Client app]
authz[Authorization server] :purple
api[Resource API] :green
user -> app : click login
app -> authz : redirect with client_id
authz -> user : consent screen
user -> authz : approve
authz -> app : code
app -> authz : code + secret
authz -> app : access token
app -> api : request + token
api -> app : data
